22
00:05:23,989 --> 00:05:26,492
Paul and Yara are here . We 're gonna watch a movie .

23
00:05:26,659 --> 00:05:30,329
- Do you feel like it ? - Actually , I 'm going out tonight .

24
00:05:30,496 --> 00:05:32,790
With that guy ?

25
00:05:33,874 --> 00:05:35,584
I like him .

26
00:05:37,503 --> 00:05:39,505
Me too .

27
00:05:58,148 --> 00:05:59,149
I see you .

28
00:06:09,869 --> 00:06:13,664
[ man on TV ] You will have access to event information

29
00:06:13,831 --> 00:06:18,502
relative to the time and strength of the forthcoming atomic test .

30
00:06:18,669 --> 00:06:20,671
[ man 2 ] What about it ?

31
00:06:21,255 --> 00:06:25,384
[ man ] You will provide us with that information as soon as it is available .

32
00:06:26,385 --> 00:06:27,386
[ man 2 ] I see .

33
00:06:27,553 --> 00:06:30,014
[ woman laughs ] OK .

34
00:06:30,180 --> 00:06:32,725
- [ man 2 ] You 're afraid of an overload . - Sounds good .

35
00:06:32,892 --> 00:06:36,270
You can 't tap enough electricity wherever you get it from to control ...

36
00:06:37,688 --> 00:06:38,898
a strong enough charge .

37
00:06:39,064 --> 00:06:43,152
You are a clever man , Doctor . Perhaps too clever .

38
00:06:43,319 --> 00:06:46,071
[ man 2 ] And what makes you think I 'll give you any information ?

39
00:06:46,238 --> 00:06:50,826
[ man ] it is the only way you can save your own life when the time comes .

40
00:06:50,993 --> 00:06:53,203
You will be transported to one of our platforms ...

41
00:06:53,370 --> 00:06:54,788
