97
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:34,002
Yeah , but she 'll cry if she actually sees it happening .

98
00:12:34,169 --> 00:12:36,296
Or she 'll just steal your cigarettes .

99
00:12:38,507 --> 00:12:40,509
