100
00:12:41,426 --> 00:12:43,220
Good .

101
00:12:43,387 --> 00:12:44,638
Mostly .

102
00:12:45,472 --> 00:12:48,517
I don 't know . He was acting kind of weird last night .

103
00:12:48,684 --> 00:12:49,810
