104
00:12:50,978 --> 00:12:55,190
He said he wasn 't feeling well , but it seemed like something was on his mind .

105
00:12:57,401 --> 00:12:59,403
Have you ... ?

106
00:12:59,569 --> 00:13:01,446
No . No .

107
00:13:01,613 --> 00:13:06,910
I know he wants to , but ... I don 't know . It seemed different last night .

108
00:13:14,042 --> 00:13:16,044
Do I smell bad ?

109
00:13:16,837 --> 00:13:20,215
Like cherry-coke banana nicotine .

110
00:13:20,382 --> 00:13:23,510
- That 's my favourite flavour . - Mum will love it .

111
