231
00:31:23,964 --> 00:31:25,966
Yeah , I know .

232
00:31:27,385 --> 00:31:29,970
What exactly is supposed to be following you ?

233
00:31:31,931 --> 00:31:34,266
I don 't know .

234
00:31:34,433 --> 00:31:36,644
