247
00:32:59,560 --> 00:33:01,312
Or a monster .

248
00:33:01,479 --> 00:33:06,859
- [ man 2 ] Andre ! Andre ! - Stop teasing him . He 's in love .

249
00:33:07,026 --> 00:33:09,236
